{
  "analog": "Prepare, validate, review, and present temporary mesh edit controls. prepare (or open) stages controls without showing them and requires an expected effect and preserved features for every axis. validate generates actual-mesh before/after and displacement-overlay images for endpoints and combinations. Inspect every image, then review each axis and combined effects using the evidenceId; accept only useful, well-behaved edits, otherwise revise and prepare again. present requires accepted current evidence. Changes to the model, fields, parts or ranges require new validation. Pending work is reminded in context. Freeze the latest visible values before saving in Blender; close cancels. Read mesh-edit-controls for intent and quality guidance. Persistent joint controls are authored in USD, independently of this workflow.",
